{"version":1,"key":"card:730","content":{"id":730,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"696934fe-12f0-42a7-af29-4e7d21734d58","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在页面关闭或跳转时上报数据是前端常见的需求，比如埋点统计、错误日志等。传统的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"XMLHttpRequest"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"fetch"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 在页面卸载阶段往往来不及发出，或者会阻塞页面跳转，影响用户体验。为了解决这个问题，浏览器提供了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"navigator.sendBeacon(url, data)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这个 API。"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"7f80cdc0-ae02-4070-a07f-c1d23b881547","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a9c12eef-3bc3-482e-83ec-0f3d2343905b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8866e7d4-5372-4db8-9c42-61969354df8b","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"url"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：数据发送的目标地址"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"725a96b5-32b7-4403-9885-421b6be1ade6","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d4659150-5104-4043-9060-a0dc1544ebc4","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"data"},{"type":"formatted","text":"：可选，支持 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ArrayBuffer"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Blob"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"DOMString"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"FormData"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"URLSearchParams"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等类型"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0ac13216-c2d7-498c-98c4-c6bc2aeb9720","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"调用后返回一个布尔值，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"true"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示浏览器已接受排队，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"false"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示提交失败。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9ea2886c-5147-4d2d-a561-d17bb0bb9adc","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"sendBeacon"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 用来向服务器发送少量数据（通常上限在 64KB 左右），它是异步的，不影响用户交互，不会阻塞页面卸载，也不会阻塞下一个页面的加载。即使页面正在关闭，浏览器也会保证把这个请求排队发出去。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"92311c15-39fe-4649-b8f1-25eb4ecc4459","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"sendBeacon"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 发出的始终是 POST 请求，并且是 fire-and-forget 模式，调用方无法获知服务端的处理结果。它的默认 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Content-Type"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"text/plain"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，如果需要发送 JSON，建议通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Blob"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 包装来指定类型："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"5cddac41-91c9-40c6-bfb2-e232403befe0","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"8fd8928a-f326-4c82-8005-448c35fda6c2","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const blob = new Blob(\n  [JSON.stringify(data)],\n  { type: 'application/json' }\n);\nnavigator.sendBeacon('/api/report', blob);","collabId":"50ce04e4-ef5f-406a-9509-1db80368fb89","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"596fb2e3-9188-44b0-b1cc-c781c2390a9a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"sendBeacon"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 在页面卸载时仍能可靠发送的特性，它最典型的应用场景就是在用户离开页面时上报数据，比如页面停留时长、行为埋点或错误日志："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"7fc0bf3b-5843-4100-8fec-4cb56806dd07","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"cf583679-0b70-4c4b-8134-fa81c12a46a0","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', () => {\n  if (document.visibilityState === 'hidden') {\n    const payload = new Blob(\n      [JSON.stringify({ page: location.href, duration: performance.now() })],\n      { type: 'application/json' }\n    );\n    navigator.sendBeacon('/analytics', payload);\n  }\n});","collabId":"086a6e69-e6e5-4bb1-afe3-deaced29565b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","title":"关于事件监听的选择","calloutType":"tip","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"878bc435-5729-475a-a214-77b7ffff00d4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"02163594-b0ff-4613-a6ef-66de33b662ec","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"监听 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"visibilitychange"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件比 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"beforeunload"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"unload"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 更可靠，因为后两者在移动端浏览器中经常不触发。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"403685b1-bf73-4995-8734-3e19953892f6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另一个常见场景是错误日志上报，当页面发生未捕获的异常时，通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"sendBeacon"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 将错误信息即时发送到服务端，即使用户随后关闭了页面也不会丢失："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"66d0110b-a4f3-406f-80cc-25c89daeeb86","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"7f393327-3cb5-4569-931f-cb652c1d2c75","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"window.addEventListener('error', (e) => {\n  const payload = new Blob(\n    [JSON.stringify({\n      message: e.message,\n      source: e.filename,\n      line: e.lineno,\n      col: e.colno,\n      timestamp: Date.now()\n    })],\n    { type: 'application/json' }\n  );\n  navigator.sendBeacon('/log/error', payload);\n});","collabId":"71ede854-ece8-44ed-be0a-6e230ac3ded7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["浏览器/sendBeacon","JavaScript"],"createTime":1779181641934,"updateTime":1779184569639,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1779184569639}}